concerns.concern:
There are multiple numerical inconsistencies, which undermine confidence in the bookkeeping:
- the D6 frequency shift (0.45 vs 0.55 GHz);
- the D6 Qi (2.8×10⁴ vs 2×10⁴);
- the onset power (−90 vs −100 dBm);
- the device count (nine vs twelve);
- the sensitivity/simulated-frequency mismatch;
- the Kerr sign flipping between abstract and conclusions.

There are formal errors in the theory section:
- Eq. 19 has a spurious μ₀ and is dimensionally wrong;
- Eq. 24 silently drops a factor π;
- Eq. 27 omits a square;
- n₀ is defined incorrectly as superfluid density per unit thickness.
